                <head>Remarks of Mr. Nelson to the President of Chili on introducing General Kilpatrick.</head>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">President:</hi> I have the honor to present to
                    your excellency Major General Judson Kilpatrick, as envoy extraordinary and
                    minister plenipotentiary of the United States of America, and in doing so I
                    bespeak for him, from your excellency and the people of Chili, that
                    consideration which is due to his eminent abilities, his exalted position, and
                    his brilliant services in the cause of republican liberty.</p>
            </div>
